<p><ul>
<h4>Direct access to online <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/" target="_blank">help</a>: <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/msa/IdrMM.htm" target="_blank"><font size="+2">IdrMM</font></a></h4>
<h4>Access the application from the menu: <br>
<i>"File | Import | Rasters | RST (Idrisi-32) -> IMG"</i><br>
<i>"File | Export | Rasters | IMG -> RST (Idrisi-32)" </i></h4>
</ul></p>
